        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. We&#x2019;ve got a lot of news to get into today, including some big developments in oncology.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-need-to-know-this-morning\">The need-to-know this morning</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Isomorphic Labs</strong>, the AI drug developer, <a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isomorphiclabs-website-public-artifacts/ISOMORPHIC_LABS_FUNDING_17-11-26.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\">raised $5 billion</a> in private financing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-sellas-blood-cancer-immunotherapy-cut-risk-of-death\">Sellas&#x2019; blood cancer immunotherapy cut risk of death</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An experimental drug from Sellas Life Sciences reduced the risk of death by 41% compared to standard treatment for patients with an advanced stage of acute myeloid leukemia, the company said this morning.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/17/biotech-news-flagship-opens-biotech-creation-uk-outpost/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
      }
